<path target="cell-2">No</path>
<path target="cell-3">Yes</path>
</cell>
<cell type="decision" id="cell-2">
<label>Examination compatible with fibrocystic disease&#x002F;mastalgia; no discrete breast mass?</label>
<path target="cell-4">Yes</path>
<path target="cell-3">No</path>
</cell>
<cell type="action" id="cell-4">
<label>Reassurance and trial of lifestyle modifications (eg, support bra, hot or cold packs)</label>
<path target="cell-5"></path>
</cell>
<cell type="decision" id="cell-5">
<label>Follow up ( 3&#x2013;6 months); symptoms controlled?</label>
<path target="cell-6">Yes</path>
<path target="cell-9">No, benign examination</path>
<path target="cell-12">No, abnormal examination</path>
</cell>
<cell type="action" id="cell-6">
<label>Routine follow-up</label>
</cell>
<cell type="action" id="cell-9">
<label>Trial of medication: topical or oral NSAIDS, OCs, or danazol, if severe</label>
<path target="cell-10"></path>
</cell>
<cell type="decision" id="cell-10">
<label>Follow up ( 3&#x2013;6 months); symptoms controlled?</label>
<path target="cell-11">Yes</path>
<path target="cell-12">No</path>
</cell>
<cell type="action" id="cell-11">
